 ch-development-sprints-10?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium
 =referral
LOCATION:Europe. Joint applications from two ETC member theatres in differe
 nt countries\; the Digital Expert works in residence with them.
END:VEVENT
