 ent and Film Education call (CREA-MEDIA-2027-AUDFILMEDU) funds projects th
 at build public interest in\, and knowledge of\, European films and audiov
 isual works\, including a dedicated strand for film heritage.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commission / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Mem
 ber States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative Europe. For organisa
 tions established in a participating country\; single applicants or consor
