SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Fonds Podiumkunsten: Productiesubsidie 2027\, r
 ound 1 (up to EUR 78\,750 per production\, EUR 105\,000 with 50% own incom
 e)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 06 Jan 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nThe Performing Arts Fund's 
 main production grant\, and the largest single-project subsidy for theatre
  and performance in the Netherlands. It funds new productions\, reprises\,
  coproductions and concours in the professional performing arts. WHO: only
  non-profit legal entities (a stichting or vereniging) whose main activity
  is professional production.\n\nOrganisation: Fonds Podiumkunsten (Perform
 ing Arts Fund NL)\nLocation: Netherlands. RESTRICTED: non-profit legal ent
 ities (stichting or vereniging) whose main activity is professional produc
 tion.\nAward: Up to EUR 78\,750 per production\; up to EUR 105\,000 if the
  production covers at least 50% of its costs from own income\; up to EUR 5
 2\,500 for a concours. Up to EUR 26\,250 extra for a new composition\, lib
 retto or theatre text. At least 20% of production costs must come from own
  income. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Per production\; the fir
 st public performance must fall at least four months after the round deadl
 ine (after 6 May 2027 for this round)\n\nMore: https://fondspodiumkunsten.
 nl/subsidies/productiesubsidie?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_m
 edium=referral
URL:https://fondspodiumkunsten.nl/subsidies/productiesubsidie?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands. RESTRICTED: non-profit legal entities (stichting or v
 ereniging) whose main activity is professional production.
END:VEVENT
