SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 CET: BPD Cultuurfonds: contributions for art in publ
 ic space (round closing 1 December 2026\; reported up to EUR 70\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Dec 2026 at 12:00 CET.\n\nBPD Cultuurfonds sponsors p
 ublicly accessible art and culture projects in the Netherlands that improv
 e the quality and experience of public or semi-public space. This is the r
 oute for large outdoor installations and artworks tied to a place. WHAT IT
  FUNDS: projects whose core is visual art\, design\, architecture or cultu
 ral heritage\, linked to climate\, energy\, nature or housing.\n\nOrganisa
 tion: Stichting BPD Cultuurfonds\nLocation: Netherlands. RESTRICTED: found
 ations\, associations and public bodies\; individuals and for-profit compa
 nies cannot apply.\nAward: Reported maximum of EUR 70\,000 per project exc
 luding VAT\, paid 80% at the start and 20% after the final report\, with c
 o-financing required. These figures come from the Fondswervingonline listi
 ng of the scheme\; the fund's own application page states no cap. No appli
 cation fee mentioned.\nDuration: Per project\; projects must start within 
 24 months of the award\n\nMore: https://www.bpdcultuurfonds.nl/aanvraag-in
 dienen/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.bpdcultuurfonds.nl/aanvraag-indienen/?utm_source=artificial
 nouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands. RESTRICTED: foundations\, associations and public bod
 ies\; individuals and for-profit companies cannot apply.
END:VEVENT
