SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Theatertreffen International Forum 2027\, Berli
 n: 18-day scholarship for emerging theatre makers (all costs covered\, no 
 stipend)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 26 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nAround 30 theatre makers at
  the start of their practice spend the whole of Theatertreffen 2027 in Ber
 lin together: watching the invited productions\, taking workshops with art
 ists\, joining artist talks and excursions\, and meeting the festival dire
 ctor and jury. The 2027 theme is The Art of Watching Theatre.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: Berliner Festspiele\, Theatertreffen\, with the Goethe-Institut\, Pro
  Helvetia and partners\nLocation: Uferstudios and Theatertreffen venues\, 
 Berlin\, Germany. Open to theatre makers from all parts of the world.\nAwa
 rd: NO CASH STIPEND\; listed as a deliberate exception. The scholarship co
 vers all participation costs: festival tickets\, travel\, Berlin public tr
 ansport\, shared accommodation\, catering or a per diem\, travel and healt
 h insurance and visa fees for those not resident in Berlin. No application
  fee mentioned.\nDuration: 6 to 23 May 2027\, with online preparatory meet
 ings in March and April 2027\n\nMore: https://www.berlinerfestspiele.de/en
 /theatertreffen/das-festival/internationales-forum/forum-open-call?utm_sou
 rce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.berlinerfestspiele.de/en/theatertreffen/das-festival/intern
 ationales-forum/forum-open-call?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_
 medium=referral
LOCATION:Uferstudios and Theatertreffen venues\, Berlin\, Germany. Open to 
 theatre makers from all parts of the world.
END:VEVENT
